+# Plan — go test suites for example.com/checkout
+
+## money/discount_test.go
+Table-driven `TestDiscount`: 0% (no discount), 100% (whole subtotal), 25% exact cents,
+negative subtotal error, percent below 0 error, percent above 100 error.
+
+## shipping/rate_test.go
+Table-driven `TestRate` over two brackets: below the first, weight equal to each
+`UpToGrams` (equality belongs to that bracket), overflow beyond the last bracket,
+negative weight error, empty brackets error.
+
+## order/total_test.go
+Fakes for `DiscountPolicy` and `ShippingCalculator` that record calls:
+- composition `1000 - 250 + 900 = 1650` with one call to each collaborator,
+- negative subtotal rejected before either collaborator runs,
+- discount failure short-circuits so shipping is never called,
+- shipping failure propagates after the discount policy ran once.
